04:13.950 --> 04:15.190
berasa gembira untuknya, bukan?

04:24.480 --> 04:24.920
Bos.

04:25.600 --> 04:26.680
Badan awak tak boleh minum arak.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.160
Ketua.

04:31.950 --> 04:32.360
Mari.

04:38.950 --> 04:39.390
Bos.

04:40.390 --> 04:42.950
